<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective Oct 24-30:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 58.78</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 62.60</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 64.36</p>
<p>Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 67.60</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$158.80</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$119.10</p>
<p>Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 83.78</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 21.09</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.11</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 23.45</p>
</text>
